      "content": "u sure?? they just seem really tired and maybe just have a bit of a sugar spike. the hospital is like 45 mins away and i dont want to drag them through the night if it's just something they can fix with some insulin and a nap. can't we just check their sugar and if it's high, give them a bit of insulin and see if they feel better in an hour?",
